# Loaded automatically by Vite when building with `--mode wallpaper`
# (see the "build:wallpaper" script in package.json).
#
# This file is safe to commit — it contains no secrets, only a build-shape
# flag. Real Supabase credentials (if you use cloud history at all) still go
# in the separate, gitignored .env file — this build variant doesn't need
# them: it boots straight into Wallpaper Mode with cloud history disabled,
# which is the correct shape for a Wallpaper Engine Workshop item (no
# backend, no ongoing hosting cost, fully offline).

VITE_WALLPAPER_ONLY=true
